<title>BELGIUM: Social Affairs Council postponed to June 27.</title>
<headline>Social Affairs Council postponed to June 27.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union social affairs and employment ministers Council has been postponed from June 12 to June 27, the Dutch presidency announced on Friday.</p>
